    assign story_body = 'SUIJI began in 2014 with a simple desire: to make jewelry that feels like you. That desire takes shape in our handmade pieces, where sculptural bases, interchangeable charms and our Core-Lock clasp give you the freedom to explore colour, form and different ways to wear a piece. Each combination makes it a little more personal. We want to take that freedom further, towards a future where everyone can wear jewelry they’ve designed themselves, with a character and a story entirely their own.'
